              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 22.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etolimuo doi ninye ajo etii entilare",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "entilare",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "eloloito",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " atua intae, enkiboraa oo nkonyek torrono nemeetae ninye tiatua iloreren lemeyiolo Enkai; eji eeta likae enkitok e menye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neton ake iwuasasa. Oo pee eitu nchirishiri, o metaba anaa nearari aaitung'uaa intae ilo otaasa ina bae? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore taa nanu te nkalo ai, hoo nematii ine to sesen atii te nkiyang'et, naidipa atudung'oki ilo enkiguana anaa katii te nkarna o Laitoriani Yesu ilo otaasa ina bae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enototo te nebo te nkarna o Laitoriani Yesu, enototo te nebo atii sii nanu te nkiyang'et, ore te ngolon o Laitoriani Yesu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "entarasaki Sheitani ilo tung'ani meitarruoi osesen lenye, pee eitajeuni kenya oltau lenye te ina Olong o Laitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
